[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702122509","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103654#issuecomment-2702122509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103654","id":2702122509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hDx4N","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T21:30:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T21:30:12Z","body":"Error message is from `AHashMap::reserve()`.  It looks like this could be caused by the below:\n\n- `AHashMap(const HashMap<> &)` calls `reserve` with the `HashMap`'s size.  The `AHashMap`'s capacity looks like it would be 0 at this point, and `get_capacity()` returns capacity + 1, so if the `HashMap` passed in is empty, it looks like the `p_new_capacity < get_capacity()` check in `reserve` would give this error.\n\n- `AnimatedValuesBackup::get_data()` shows up when profiling while the error is printing.  This method builds up a `HashMap`, then returns it as `AHashMap`.  If there are no values, this might trigger the above scenario.  This could probably change to just use `AHashMap` directly, but the `AHashMap` constructor might still need to change to handle empty `HashMap`s.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702122509/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2703977240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103654#issuecomment-2703977240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103654","id":2703977240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hK2sY","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T14:16:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T14:16:02Z","body":"I believe this is a bug in the way `AHashMap` is constructed, will investigate","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2703977240/reactions",